---
// Quiz figure for the color post, Uxq05: the same KPI card in colour and in grayscale (equal luma, 74).
---
<div class="qfig-uxq05greyscalekpi">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 190" role="img" aria-label="Two KPI cards. In colour, p95 latency 12 percent is dark green and error rate 12 percent is dark red. In grayscale both lines are the same grey and read identically.">
<text x="150" y="22" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Colour</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Có màu</tspan></text>
<rect x="20" y="34" width="260" height="124" rx="10" class="card" />
<text x="40" y="76" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>p95 latency</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Độ trễ p95</tspan></text>
<text x="260" y="78" text-anchor="end" style="font-size:26px;font-weight:700" fill="#175A3C">12%</text>
<text x="40" y="132" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Error rate</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tỷ lệ lỗi</tspan></text>
<text x="260" y="134" text-anchor="end" style="font-size:26px;font-weight:700" fill="#C62828">12%</text>
<text x="450" y="22" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Grayscale</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đen trắng</tspan></text>
<rect x="320" y="34" width="260" height="124" rx="10" class="card" />
<text x="340" y="76" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>p95 latency</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Độ trễ p95</tspan></text>
<text x="560" y="78" text-anchor="end" style="font-size:26px;font-weight:700" fill="#4A4A4A">12%</text>
<text x="340" y="132" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>Error rate</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tỷ lệ lỗi</tspan></text>
<text x="560" y="134" text-anchor="end" style="font-size:26px;font-weight:700" fill="#4A4A4A">12%</text>
<text x="300" y="182" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Change since last week</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Thay đổi so với tuần trước</tspan></text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-uxq05greyscalekpi { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-uxq05greyscalekpi svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-uxq05greyscalekpi text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-uxq05greyscalekpi .h { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-uxq05greyscalekpi .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .qfig-uxq05greyscalekpi .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-uxq05greyscalekpi .w { fill: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; }
</style>
